        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have undertaken measures designed to limit the provision of services or support to those Russian subsidiaries and the receiving or sending of any financial information to or from the subsidiaries, and we have taken measures to stop the collection or sending of funds to or from Russia.",
        "start_character": 100165,
        "end_character": 100453
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our business through three reportable segments: (1) Americas, which includes North America and Latin America;",
        "start_character": 52373,
        "end_character": 52493
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Data Management – We are committed to safeguarding all of our digital information and delivering secure, accurate and relevant market and consumer data, enabling clients to gain meaningful insights that drive informed business decisions and foster growth.",
        "start_character": 86224,
        "end_character": 86480
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We manage more than approximately 160 petabytes of data and maintain proprietary databases with over ten billion product attributes, averaging over 40 attributes per product, including color, size, density, packaging and beyond, for each SKU sold and over 246 million unique product items managed in omnichannel and eCommerce retail, which we believe is one of the largest of its kind.",
        "start_character": 55375,
        "end_character": 55761
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to working with this data, we operate in rapidly evolving global markets characterized by shifting consumer-driven market dynamics, the growth of generative AI and increasingly complex data regulations—particularly the expanding U.S.",
        "start_character": 89005,
        "end_character": 89250
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In response to these developments, we have had to undertake changes in how we operate in Russia and Belarus.",
        "start_character": 99827,
        "end_character": 99935
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Leveraging our strong NIQ brand, long-term client relationships, global scale, proprietary technology and extensive data and insights, we are positioned as a global leader in measuring, analyzing and predicting consumer behavior in the FMCG vertical, T&D and other verticals in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 1201,
        "end_character": 1496
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also see significant opportunities to broaden and deepen our footprint in developing markets, including Latin America and Asia Pacific.",
        "start_character": 64621,
        "end_character": 64759
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We estimate that this market has $20 billion whitespace and we believe it provides us significant whitespace to cross-sell and upsell our Activation solutions and penetrate new markets.",
        "start_character": 51209,
        "end_character": 51394
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We implement measures designed to safeguard information and ensure its relevance and accuracy, including data minimization standards and retention periods.",
        "start_character": 90339,
        "end_character": 90494
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We maintain an adaptive posture designed to ensure consistent controls and localized implementation through the NIQ Privacy Program.",
        "start_character": 89625,
        "end_character": 89757
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012572",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012572-28c4045530d6b690",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012572",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We manage a comprehensive and integrated ecosystem – The NIQ Ecosystem – which combines proprietary data, best-in-class technology, human intelligence and highly sophisticated software applications and analytics solutions (the “Ecosystem” or “The NIQ Ecosystem”).",
        "start_character": 358,
        "end_character": 621
